    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PSYKO is a brutally-fast motorcycle combat game. Outrun and outgun while squeezing through traffic at breakneck speeds. Traffic is your arena, and danger is fuel. Ride the line between blistering pace and tactical precision. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traffic is your arena.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outrun and outgun as you maneuver through traffic. Use cars as cover, dodge fire and bash bikes to cause collisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702250/extras/0b258c07f65dff0188917143ce339f79.poster.avif?t=1739571010\" width=434 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702250/extras/0b258c07f65dff0188917143ce339f79.webm?t=1739571010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702250/extras/0b258c07f65dff0188917143ce339f79.mp4?t=1739571010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Danger is Fuel.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squeeze dangerously through traffic while performing risky maneuvers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702250/extras/cc62bdb88767437eb92266513ed5ea05.poster.avif?t=1739571010\" width=434 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702250/extras/cc62bdb88767437eb92266513ed5ea05.webm?t=1739571010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702250/extras/cc62bdb88767437eb92266513ed5ea05.mp4?t=1739571010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feel like a badass.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill enemy motorcyles by popping car doors. Flip over cars for upside down headshots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702250/extras/0b391999d3cdeeb3b963de2cf6ba612d.poster.avif?t=1739571010\" width=434 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702250/extras/0b391999d3cdeeb3b963de2cf6ba612d.webm?t=1739571010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702250/extras/0b391999d3cdeeb3b963de2cf6ba612d.mp4?t=1739571010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
